{'symbol': 'EXR', 'date': '2021-07-27 16:10:00', 'title': 'EXTRA SPACE STORAGE INC. REPORTS 2021 SECOND QUARTER RESULTS', 'text': 'SALT LAKE CITY, JULY\xa027, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EXTRA SPACE STORAGE INC. (NYSE: EXR) (THE "COMPANY"), A LEADING OWNER AND OPERATOR OF SELF-STORAGE FACILITIES IN THE UNITED STATES AND A MEMBER OF THE S&P 500, ANNOUNCED OPERATING RESULTS FOR THE THREE AND SIX MONTHS ENDED JUNE 30, 2021. HIGHLIGHTS FOR THE THREE MONTHS ENDED JUNE 30, 2021: ACHIEVED NET INCOME ATTRIBUTABLE TO COMMON STOCKHOLDERS OF $1.25 PER DILUTED SHARE, REPRESENTING A 56.3% INCREASE COMPARED TO THE SAME PERIOD IN 2020.'}